<!--
  Chevron for the trending-posts card's advance control.

  The path is the app's own `ChevronRight` glyph (assets/icons/chevron-right-icon.tsx), so
  "forward" is the same shape on the home screen as it is inside the app. Drawn in white and
  tinted at draw time by `CircleIconButton`'s `contentColor`, which is what keeps it legible
  under both dynamic and fallback colours.

  Its own file rather than a reference to `mention_widget_see_all.xml`, which happens to carry
  the same glyph today: that one belongs to the trends title bar and means "open the full
  list", this one means "next post". Per-family resources are the convention throughout this
  module — the same reason the two widget families keep separate `strings` files.
-->
